{"id": 9132, "name": "Sagitawah RV Park", "read": "2026-10-16", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.sagitawahrv.com/", "lines": []}, {"url": "https://www.sagitawahrv.com/rates", "lines": [" We can handle the big rigs, with large pull through sites, as well as offer more private treed sites. We've been operating in the Whitecourt area for over 20 years and we look forwards to serving you. | | Power/Water | $39.oo/Night | 15 Amp/water | + applicable Tax | Full Service | $42.oo/Night | 30 AMP/water/sewer | + applicable Tax | $30.oo/Night | Tent Sites | + applicable Tax | Daily Rates | Workers Welcomed. Pl", "or our weekly and monthly rates | Rates are not per site but for each recreational vehicle (RV), or tent, on a site. | ​ | Our rates for each RV or tent include 2 adults and 2 children. | ​ | There is an extra charge of $3.00 per night for each adult, or child, over their respective limit. We do not charge extra for children 5 and under. | ​ | If you plan to have additional RVs or tents on your site, or you have extr", "ve additional RVs or tents on your site, or you have extra people, please inform our staff and we can explain our rates. | ​ | If you want to host friends or family at the campground there is a Day-Pass available. It is $10.00 for 2 adults and 2 children and $2.00 per person over that number. ​ | Check-out is at Noon. We do offer a late check-out (if-available) for between 2:00 PM and 6:00 PM for $10.00. | ​ | Check ", "nd there is a Day-Pass available. It is $10.00 for 2 adults and 2 children and $2.00 per person over that number. ​ | Check-out is at Noon. We do offer a late check-out (if-available) for between 2:00 PM and 6:00 PM for $10.00. | ​ | Check in is 2 PM. We also offer early check-ins (if available) for an additional $10.00. | ​ | | 48 Hour Reservation Cancellation Policy | If you have guaranteed your reservation with a "], "via": "RATES |"}]}
